language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ A magic sequence of length n: the number i occurs exactly x_i times in the sequence, for i from 0 to n-1.
given n : int(1..20)
find x : matrix indexed by [int(1..n)] of int(0..n-1)

branching on [x]

such that
$ each number i in 0..n-1 occurs exactly x_i times in the sequence (the count of value i is x[i+1])
forAll i : int(0..n-1) . ((sum j : int(1..n) . toInt(x[j] = i)) = x[i+1])
